^{:go/end 2488} (go/func LibmCall "LibmCall evaluates a libm function by its C name on arguments given as bit patterns (a double's 64 bits, a\nfloat's 32), its result as bits; ok false for an unknown name (bin/hsi libm-check's subject)\n" [^string name ^uint64 a ^uint64 b] :results [uint64 bool]
